  "description": {
    "en": "Toroline DREDDY is a dynamic dual-poly hybrid inspired by Dustin Brown's creative and explosive style. It combines firm O-TORO TOUR Green 1.23 mains with softer O-TORO SNAP Yellow 1.25 crosses. The shaped mains provide aggressive bite, spin, control and durability, while the ultra-slick round crosses reduce friction and deliver fast snapback, plush pocketing and added feel. The result is a lively, spin-friendly and highly expressive setup for players who want to attack with variety, confidence and precision.",

    "zh": "Toroline DREDDY 是一套以 Dustin Brown 创意型、爆发型打法为灵感的双聚酯 Hybrid。主线采用偏硬的 O-TORO TOUR Green 1.23，通过六边形结构提供强咬球、旋转、控制和耐久；横线采用更柔和、超光滑的 O-TORO SNAP Yellow 1.25，降低主横线摩擦并提供快速 Snapback、Plush Pocketing 和更丰富的手感。整体是一套兼顾 Spin、Control、Feel 和 Creativity 的配置，适合喜欢主动变化、积极进攻并追求自由击球感的球员。"
  },

